{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543770/extras/2b45ba191a60f51812587d494e38ff34.avif?t=1759343186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543770/extras_big/2b45ba191a60f51812587d494e38ff34.webp?t=1759343186 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a young security guard entangled in the gritty underworld of the mafia. Your life has been anything but ordinary. The boss's daughter is smitten with you, but lurking in the shadows are formidable foes with the power to shatter your world and your loved ones.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543770/extras/833b491aa66e2feab2b70257df1719b5.poster.avif?t=1759343186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543770/extras/833b491aa66e2feab2b70257df1719b5.webm?t=1759343186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543770/extras/833b491aa66e2feab2b70257df1719b5.mp4?t=1759343186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the treacherous criminal landscape and uncover the twists and turns of your potential destiny. Will you rise or fall in this captivating tale of crime, love, and redemption?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543770/extras/b847d92d61802d4efa50aa8a009e44f5.poster.avif?t=1759343186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543770/extras/b847d92d61802d4efa50aa8a009e44f5.webm?t=1759343186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It Was Raining That Night&quot; is a story-based game set in the dangerous mafia underworld. As a young security guard, you must navigate treacherous paths, face formidable foes, and navigate a complex web of love and danger. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543770/extras/198af454c365e055d5db9eaa55354659.poster.avif?t=1759343186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543770/extras/198af454c365e055d5db9eaa55354659.webm?t=1759343186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543770/extras/198af454c365e055d5db9eaa55354659.mp4?t=1759343186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your choices will determine your destiny in this thrilling tale of crime, love, and redemption. Don't miss the chance to experience a gripping narrative where every decision matters. Will you rise or fall in this captivating world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543770/extras/8f2ed68b98524ebd3725a6ed09e3b276.poster.avif?t=1759343186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543770/extras/8f2ed68b98524ebd3725a6ed09e3b276.webm?t=1759343186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fully Adult","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2543770/e02af0044666ee5e48095e8f48868923b4848